{
  "mn50:0.1": "Middle Discourses 50 ",
  "mn50:0.2": "The Warning to Māra ",
  "mn50:1.1": "So I have heard. ",
  "mn50:1.2": "At one time Venerable Mahāmoggallāna was staying in the land of the Bhaggas at Crocodile’s Bellow, in the deer park at Bhesakaḷā’s Wood. ",
  "mn50:2.1": "At that time Moggallāna was walking mindfully in the open air. ",
  "mn50:2.2": "Now at that time Māra the Wicked had got inside Moggallāna’s belly. ",
  "mn50:2.3": "Moggallāna thought, ",
  "mn50:2.4": "“Why now is my belly so very heavy, ",
  "mn50:2.5": "like I’ve just eaten a load of beans?” ",
  "mn50:2.6": "Then he stepped down from the walking path, entered his dwelling, sat down on the seat spread out, ",
  "mn50:3.1": "and investigated inside himself. ",
  "mn50:3.2": "He saw that Māra the Wicked had got inside his belly. ",
  "mn50:3.3": "So he said to Māra, ",
  "mn50:3.4": "“Come out, Wicked One, ",
  "mn50:3.5": "come out! ",
  "mn50:3.6": "Do not harass the Realized One or his disciple. ",
  "mn50:3.7": "Don’t create lasting harm and suffering for yourself!” ",
  "mn50:4.1": "Then Māra thought, ",
  "mn50:4.2": "“This ascetic doesn’t really know me or see me when he tells me to come out. ",
  "mn50:4.3": "",
  "mn50:4.4": "",
  "mn50:4.5": "",
  "mn50:4.6": "",
  "mn50:4.7": "Not even the Teacher could recognize me so quickly, so how could a disciple?” ",
  "mn50:5.1": "Then Moggallāna said to Māra, ",
  "mn50:5.2": "“I know you even when you’re like this, Wicked One. Do not 